<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Nov 21.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Nov 21.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
